<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Look What You've Done</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Radio Free Alice</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Radio Free Alice</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4zLfJHBHtyQFBf4Wc0NFuM</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.235" end="00:42.473">Katie’s in the bedroom screaming at the enemy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.473" end="00:45.723">I’m in the bathroom praying to obliterate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.723" end="00:49.207">The man on the small screen, fangs on, some cape</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.207" end="00:52.475">I wonder what my boy will say, when he hears Kate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.475" end="00:53.975">I’ve loved her bones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.928" end="00:55.663">Derivative moans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.663" end="00:58.741">I don’t know how we’re doing this again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.741" end="01:00.291">Well the phone’s tapped anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.291" end="01:02.428">All I hear my Katie say:</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.428" end="01:04.310" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.310" end="01:07.594">Now look what you’ve done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.594" end="01:11.112">You laugh in my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.112" end="01:14.611">You’re dragging me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.611" end="01:17.725">You pull on my hair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.725" end="01:20.916">Now look what you’ve done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.916" end="01:24.313">You hate all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.313" end="01:27.445">You hate everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.445" end="01:31.677">Our love is the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.677" end="01:34.822">Your secret diet of cigarettes and ketamine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.822" end="01:37.753">I know this bed has let another fella in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.753" end="01:44.611">Now I sit self-consciously ridin' with my girl in the passenger seat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.611" end="01:51.209">I see our life, our family, as a Christmas dome of self-pity</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.209" end="01:52.709">I’m not a child</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.702" end="01:55.651">I can’t do it anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.651" end="01:57.151" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.401" end="01:59.926">Now look what you’ve done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.926" end="02:03.360">You laugh in my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.360" end="02:06.521">You’re dragging me down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.521" end="02:09.444">You pull on my hair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.444" end="02:13.200">Now look what you’ve done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.200" end="02:16.444">You hate all my friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.444" end="02:19.747">You hate everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.747" end="02:23.101">Our love is the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.101" end="02:31.101" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.172" end="02:41.661">You quiver with rage as you walk up the stairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.661" end="02:45.127">I know I can’t say anything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.127" end="02:48.542">There was a time when we'd speak all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.542" end="02:51.713">Now we don’t say anything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.713" end="02:53.213" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.523" end="02:55.817">You quiver with rage as you walk up the stairs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.817" end="02:59.288">I know I can’t say anything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.288" end="03:02.982">There was a time when we'd speak all night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.982" end="03:06.982">Now you don’t say anything</p></div></body></tt>